ir. It offers a high level of comfort and plenty of adjustability, though it’s tricky to build and up against some very strong competition at its price.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>UNITED KINGDOM</span> <span>01/02/2026</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Destrier Ergo Gaming Chair Media review Award of TechRadar Recommends\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.techradar.com/gaming/asus-rog-destrier-core-gaming-chair-review\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1339/202304142303177800229.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"4/5 stars\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Dexerto\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>4/5 stars</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The Destrier is easily one of the roomiest chairs we’ve personally had the pleasure of using.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>UNITED KINGDOM</span> <span>09/05/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Destrier Ergo Gaming Chair Media review Award of 4/5 stars\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.dexerto.com/tech/asus-rog-destrier-ergo-gaming-chair-review-2272779/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1339/202306131901371880565.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"4 star\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Gamesradar\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>4 star</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      GamesRadar+ &quot;The Asus ROG Destrier Ergo chair is the latest in a new line of premium gaming chairs that promote supreme comfort while beautifully supporting your body. This might just be the best premium gaming chair on the marke,t&quot;\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>UNITED KINGDOM</span> <span>06/12/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Destrier Ergo Gaming Chair Media review Award of 4 star\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.gamesradar.com/asus-rog-destrier-ergo-chair-review/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1265/202602122116451870153.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Vendor of the Year 2025 - Gaming Chairs (2nd Place)\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      pcgameshardware.de\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Vendor of the Year 2025 - Gaming Chairs (2nd Place)</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      PCGH Reader's Choice Awards 2025\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>GERMANY</span> <span>02/06/2026</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Destrier Ergo Gaming Chair Media review Award of Vendor of the Year 2025 - Gaming Chairs (2nd Place)\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.pcgameshardware.de/PC-Games-Hardware-Brands-18366/News/Leserwahl-2025-1489258/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1265/202303161920506230760.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Allround PC Gaming Chairs Recommendation\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      allround-pc.com\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Allround PC Gaming Chairs Recommendation</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The ROG Destrier Ergo is a welcome change for the eye and the back from all the other gaming chairs that often prioritize a cool racing look over ergonomic features. It is a high-quality and very comfortable office chair with many adjustment options, some of which are especially designed for gaming.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>GERMANY</span> <span>03/10/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Destrier Ergo Gaming Chair Media review Award of Allround PC Gaming Chairs Recommendation\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.allround-pc.com/artikel/gadgets/2023/asus-rog-destrier-ergo-test-gaming-stuhl-komfort-statt-racinglook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1337/15445.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Excellent\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      NewEsc España\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Excellent</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      Truly spectacular design with this Cyborg style look.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>SPAIN</span> <span>05/14/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Destrier Ergo Gaming Chair Media review Award of Excellent\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://newesc.com/review-asus-rog-destrier-ergo/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1337/201911252353119720633.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Platinum\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Profesional Review\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Platinum</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      it is a chair from another planet\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>SPAIN</span> <span>03/16/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Destrier Ergo Gaming Chair Media review Award of Platinum\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.profesionalreview.com/2023/03/16/asus-rog-destrier-ergo-gaming-chair-review/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1349/202003041425414960716.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Innovation Design Award\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      XFastest\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Innovation Design Award</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      Speaking of ROG gaming chairs, I believe players will be familiar with the ROG CHARIOT gaming chair code-named SL300C with RGB lighting. The standard barrel shape and trendy RGB lighting are definitely the most eye-catching existence among many gaming chairs. , and this time the newly launched ROG Destrier Ergo Gaming Chair, code-named SL400, re-examines the needs of players for chairs, and builds a new gaming chair based on mesh chairs.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>TAIWAN</span> <span>04/18/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Destrier Ergo Gaming Chair Media review Award of Innovation Design Award\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.xfastest.com/thread-274430-1-1.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li></ul></div> <!----></div> <div class=\"ProductAward__rewardMoreButton__NCAU7\"><div class=\"seeAllButton__seeAllButton__dIrKX seeAllButton__visible__OJDnB\"><button tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Xem tất cả Giải thưởng\" class=\"robotoFont seeAllButton__text__TNQDv\"><span>\n      Xem tất cả\n    </span> <svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"non